            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "cfc59c1a-ddf0-4bdb-b706-64ab9e18fe6c",
                "quote": "我又不是火車站相關人員，我不想負那個責任",
                "start": 19,
                "end": 39
              },
              {
                "message_id": "6b9c1599-5397-4455-91e0-3db2ba2d964c",
                "quote": "這種事應該是鐵路公司的人去處理，我只是路過。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 22
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "2675ed7b-d135-405f-b182-292d2627ea0e",
                "quote": "不推，理由一樣，我沒有義務。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
